<title>GREECE: KOUFOPOULOS, MONOKROUSOS GO TO BANK OF AMERICA.</title>
<headline>KOUFOPOULOS, MONOKROUSOS GO TO BANK OF AMERICA.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Constantine Koufopoulos, formerly with Haramis-Cox brokers, has joined the money market desk at Bank of America, Athens, sources said.</p>
<p>Platon Monokrousos, formerly with Imerisia financial daily, has also joined the Bank of America as junior money market dealer and financial analyst. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
